lustre: metallic
clarity: opaque

@mineral gypsum
name: Gypsum
formula: CaSO4·2H2O
atoms: Ca S O O O O O O H H H H
colour: 0.95 0.94 0.9
lustre: pearly
clarity: clear

@mineral halite
