lustre: vitreous
clarity: clear

@mineral sea-water
name: Sea water
formula: H2O with dissolved salt
atoms: O H H O H H O H H O H H O H H O H H O H H O H H O H H Na Cl
colour: 0.2 0.4 0.6
lustre: wet
clarity: clear

@mineral dry-ice
name: Carbon dioxide ice
formula: CO2
atoms: C O O
